@startuml SEQ04_rafraichissement_dashboard
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #333333
  LifeLineBorderColor #888888
  ParticipantBackgroundColor white
  ParticipantBorderColor #666666
  ActorBackgroundColor white
  ActorBorderColor #333333
  BoxBackgroundColor #F8F8F8
  BoxBorderColor #AAAAAA
  NoteBackgroundColor #FFFFEE
  NoteBorderColor #AAAAAA
}

title SEQ04 - Consultation KPIs via dashboard Angular\nAngular 17 -> Spring Boot 3.3 -> PostgreSQL 15

actor "Utilisateur\n(Directeur/Analyste)" as USER
participant "Angular 17\n(KpiComponent)" as ANG
participant "AuthInterceptor\n(HttpInterceptor)" as INTER
participant "Spring Boot API\n(:8080)" as SPRING
participant "KpiController\n(@RestController)" as CTRL
participant "KpiService\n(Java)" as JAVASVC
database "PostgreSQL 15\nschema dw" as PG

USER -> ANG : Ouvre dashboard KPIs

ANG -> ANG : AuthGuard verifie\ncookie imf_access (HttpOnly)

ANG -> INTER : GET /api/v1/directeur/kpis\n?dateDebut=...&dateFin=...&agenceId=...
note over INTER : Cookie imf_access\nenvoye automatiquement par le navigateur

INTER -> SPRING : GET /api/v1/directeur/kpis [Cookie: imf_access]
activate SPRING

SPRING -> SPRING : JwtAuthFilter\nValide cookie imf_access\nExtrait userId et role

SPRING -> SPRING : @PreAuthorize\nVerifie role DIRECTEUR ou ANALYSTE_CREDIT

SPRING -> CTRL : Route vers KpiController
activate CTRL

CTRL -> JAVASVC : kpiService.getKpis(params)
activate JAVASVC

JAVASVC -> PG : SELECT FROM dw.mart_kpi_recouvrement\nWHERE agence_id = ?\nAND date_snapshot BETWEEN ? AND ?\nORDER BY date_snapshot
note right : Vue pre-agregee\nreponse < 200ms

PG --> JAVASVC : ResultSet (KPIs par jour/agence)

JAVASVC -> PG : SELECT FROM dw.mart_kpi_collecte\nWHERE agence_id = ?\nAND date_snapshot BETWEEN ? AND ?

PG --> JAVASVC : ResultSet collectes

JAVASVC -> JAVASVC : mapToDto()\nResultSet -> KpiResponse

deactivate JAVASVC
CTRL --> SPRING : KpiResponse
deactivate CTRL

SPRING --> INTER : 200 OK\n{totalCollectes, montantTotal,\ntauxPAR30, tauxPAR90, series: [...]}
deactivate SPRING

INTER --> ANG : 200 OK - donnees JSON

ANG -> ANG : Mise a jour composants\n(Chart.js graphiques\nAngular Material tableaux)

ANG --> USER : Dashboard affiche\n(graphiques + KPIs + filtres)

note over USER, PG : Chaque filtre (agence, periode)\ndeclenche un nouvel appel GET\nAngular HttpClient + RxJS debounce 300ms

@enduml
